              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">cb4bb9c6-83d5-4023-81d4-553f88f989d7</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">READ FIRST</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">NONPLANAR PRINTING / classroom copy of design.gh
1. PATH: where the nozzle goes.  2. FRAME: how the nozzle is oriented.
Wave amplitude changes geometry. follow_layer changes axes only. Neither chooses MoveP / MoveL.
Open each numbered script: all calculations are explained in English comments.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="2">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="4">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>100</X>
