                          <W>3260</W>
                          <H>110</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="MarginLeft" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                        <item name="MarginRight" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                        <item name="MarginTop" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                    <chunk name="PanelProperties">
                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Colour" type_name="gh_drawing_color" type_code="36">
                          <ARGB>0;255;249;89</ARGB>
                        </item>
                        <item name="DrawIndices" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                        <item name="DrawPaths" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                        <item name="Multiline" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                        <item name="SpecialCodes" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                        <item name="Stream" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                        <item name="Wrap" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                  </chunks>
                </chunk>
              </chunks>
            </chunk>
            <chunk name="Object" index="32">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">59e0b89a-e487-49f8-bab8-b5bab16be14c</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">7dde0542-b931-45d0-b9cf-ecbd7912c395</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">01 / PATH lesson</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">PATH = POSITION
Z(theta) = nominal_z + amplitude_here * sin(wave_count * theta).
Amplitude fades from zero at the bed to full value at the top.
wave_amp=0: horizontal rings. wave_amp&gt;0: nonplanar rings.
wave_amp [mm]; wave_count [integer]; all lengths [mm].
The top rim spans height +/- wave_amp. Point spacing controls sampling, not wave size.
One flat priming ring surrounds the model. Body paths are closed rings, NOT a spiral.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="2">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="4">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>100</X>
                          <Y>520</Y>
                          <W>600</W>
                          <H>230</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="MarginLeft" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                        <item name="MarginRight" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                        <item name="MarginTop" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                    <chunk name="PanelProperties">
                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Colour" type_name="gh_drawing_color" type_code="36">
                          <ARGB>0;255;249;89</ARGB>
                        </item>
                        <item name="DrawIndices" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                        <item name="DrawPaths" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                        <item name="Multiline" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                        <item name="SpecialCodes" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                        <item name="Stream" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                        <item name="Wrap" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                  </chunks>
                </chunk>
              </chunks>
            </chunk>
            <chunk name="Object" index="33">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">59e0b89a-e487-49f8-bab8-b5bab16be14c</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">2ac088c9-5836-4e9b-9921-20d7ad053b63</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">02 / FRAME lesson</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">FRAME = POSITION + X/Y AXES
False: original fixed orientation. True: follow the local wavy layer.
Radial R x layer tangent T gives an UPWARD supporting-layer normal.
Course tool Z points DOWN, so tool_Z = -normal_up.
Do not use the outer vertical wall normal: that points sideways.
Crests / valleys: nearly vertical nozzle. Wave slopes: largest tilt.
Stable projected heading avoids forcing X to rotate once per ring. It does not validate robot IK.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="2">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="4">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
