                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">WHAT TO LOOK AT
The path is complete, but axes are sampled on the flat first and wavy last body rings.
Blue lines are tool Z, pointing DOWN in this course convention.
Toggle follow_layer and compare: same path, different axes.
Travel segments connect the surrounding priming ring and body through an extruder-off lifted midpoint.
Ring-to-ring transitions remain. This is a teaching scaffold, not the production spiral path.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="2">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="4">
