              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">baf554e0-579b-483e-9cc6-04a0e63bf0b4</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">04 / CLASS EXERCISE</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">THREE COMPARISONS
A. wave_amp=0, follow_layer=False: planar path + vertical tool.
B. wave_amp=4, follow_layer=False: nonplanar path + vertical tool.
C. wave_amp=4, follow_layer=True: SAME nonplanar path + varying tool direction.
Save button writes ONLY data/lesson_nonplanar_printpoints.json. Saving is not sending.
TCP, collision checks, IK, extrusion presets and production sender compatibility are separate tasks.</item>
                  </items>
